(810580, 90850, 8860, '<td valign="top">A great sign, but a shame you couldn''t get a human in view to give it context. Composition is awkward and too centred. Lighting is quite flat.</td>', 'A great sign, but a shame you couldn''t get a human in view to give it context. Composition is awkward and too centred. Lighting is quite flat.', '2004-07-14 07:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
