(810704, 90799, 23394, '<td valign="top">try to avoid cutting off feet and hands; when they''re missing, they distract from the rest of the picture.  street photography is tough, especially if you don''t have permission from your subjects (or if you don''t know if they will come after you).  also, shooting midday is tough on the lighting.  however, if you have permission, you can get some interesting results by underexposing and using a flash.</td>', 'try to avoid cutting off feet and hands; when they''re missing, they distract from the rest of the picture.  street photography is tough, especially if you don''t have permission from your subjects (or if you don''t know if they will come after you).  also, shooting midday is tough on the lighting.  however, if you have permission, you can get some interesting results by underexposing and using a flash.', '2004-07-14 09:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
