(810840, 90634, 13136, '<td valign="top">I love this type of "slice of real life" shot. Seems like it could use a little level to darken a bit. Looks like a crop of a small part of a larger picture with the grain on the man and paper.</td>', 'I love this type of "slice of real life" shot. Seems like it could use a little level to darken a bit. Looks like a crop of a small part of a larger picture with the grain on the man and paper.', '2004-07-14 11:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
