(811005, 90408, 19831, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great example of "using words in a creative composition". So many pictures of just signs and what not. I really like how the sign and the cat are in opposite corners of the frame. The lighting seems maybe a wee drab, but not too bad in this case. The green leaf is a nice touch of color, I wish it were somewhere else on the fence, it seems to close to the cat. Your models expression really makes the shot. :-) How much do you pay her/him? Also a great example of making a "cat" picture fit the challenge nicely. Good job.</td>', 'I think this is a great example of "using words in a creative composition". So many pictures of just signs and what not. I really like how the sign and the cat are in opposite corners of the frame. The lighting seems maybe a wee drab, but not too bad in this case. The green leaf is a nice touch of color, I wish it were somewhere else on the fence, it seems to close to the cat. Your models expression really makes the shot. :-) How much do you pay her/him? Also a great example of making a "cat" picture fit the challenge nicely. Good job.', '2004-07-14 12:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(811008, 90052, 19831, '<td valign="top">I like your idea here. The setting is nice in it''s simplicity. I get the feeling of breakfast for only one though. And I think the toast is a little burnt, seems kind of unappealing.</td>', 'I like your idea here. The setting is nice in it''s simplicity. I get the feeling of breakfast for only one though. And I think the toast is a little burnt, seems kind of unappealing.', '2004-07-14 12:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(811011, 91096, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great colors. Good macro of a bug. But, did you know what this challenge was?  Where are the words?</td>', 'Great colors. Good macro of a bug. But, did you know what this challenge was?  Where are the words?', '2004-07-14 12:48:29.000000', NULL, 1);
