(811170, 90752, 22922, '<td valign="top">A nice idea, but your lighting is too low, and the camera was unable to capture the detail and sharpness necessary for the image.  Try more ambient light with the same exposure length, or lengthen the exposure some but shade the visible ligt sources so you don''t get spots of bright white. I might suggest cropping the nightstand out as well, it''s a little out of place.</td>', 'A nice idea, but your lighting is too low, and the camera was unable to capture the detail and sharpness necessary for the image.  Try more ambient light with the same exposure length, or lengthen the exposure some but shade the visible ligt sources so you don''t get spots of bright white. I might suggest cropping the nightstand out as well, it''s a little out of place.', '2004-07-14 14:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(811172, 89929, 23614, '<td valign="top">Funny!  :)</td>', 'Funny!  :)', '2004-07-14 14:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(811174, 90261, 19751, '<td valign="top">too compressed</td>', 'too compressed', '2004-07-14 14:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(811175, 90119, 22922, '<td valign="top">Ok, but how is this *your* art?  Work on capturing interest using your camera, not just taking pictures of things.  I could go to wherever this is and see the exact same sign, so why do I need your picture of it?  Use creativity and composition, and I''m sure you''ll score higher next time.</td>', 'Ok, but how is this *your* art?  Work on capturing interest using your camera, not just taking pictures of things.  I could go to wherever this is and see the exact same sign, so why do I need your picture of it?  Use creativity and composition, and I''m sure you''ll score higher next time.', '2004-07-14 14:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(811176, 91052, 19751, '<td valign="top">not in focus</td>', 'not in focus', '2004-07-14 14:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
