(811228, 90119, 21478, '<td valign="top">This would have been nicer with the train tracks also included - and with a more "front-on" image of the sign.</td>', 'This would have been nicer with the train tracks also included - and with a more "front-on" image of the sign.', '2004-07-14 14:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(811231, 89993, 19751, '<td valign="top">the spikey hair is kinda distracting...and the paper is a little wet...  otherwise, i like it</td>', 'the spikey hair is kinda distracting...and the paper is a little wet...  otherwise, i like it', '2004-07-14 14:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(811233, 90334, 21478, '<td valign="top">I think this loses out not being in color.</td>', 'I think this loses out not being in color.', '2004-07-14 14:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(811234, 90494, 22922, '<td valign="top">If you did this setup yourself, I think it''s a 10.  If you saw it and took a picture, it''s an 8.  Since I don''t know, you get a 9 :)  Nice use of light and shadow.  Very thought provoking image, it makes you want to look at it for a while to get all the nuances.</td>', 'If you did this setup yourself, I think it''s a 10.  If you saw it and took a picture, it''s an 8.  Since I don''t know, you get a 9 :)  Nice use of light and shadow.  Very thought provoking image, it makes you want to look at it for a while to get all the nuances.', '2004-07-14 14:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(811235, 89743, 10959, '<td valign="top">Elephantitis.  Powerful photo, unfortunately, it doesn''t meet the challenge.</td>', 'Elephantitis.  Powerful photo, unfortunately, it doesn''t meet the challenge.', '2004-07-14 14:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(811236, 90119, 19751, '<td valign="top">way too small</td>', 'way too small', '2004-07-14 14:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(811238, 91049, 21478, '<td valign="top">The light in this image seems a bit flat. Perhaps shot with more sidelighting, and a polarizer (to remove the reflection from the glass on left) would add more impact to this (in my humble opinion).  Just a side note - having the title replicate the focus of the image does nothing - give it some flair or describe it - don''t just repeat it (again - just my opinion).</td>', 'The light in this image seems a bit flat. Perhaps shot with more sidelighting, and a polarizer (to remove the reflection from the glass on left) would add more impact to this (in my humble opinion).  Just a side note - having the title replicate the focus of the image does nothing - give it some flair or describe it - don''t just repeat it (again - just my opinion).', '2004-07-14 14:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(811239, 90302, 10959, '<td valign="top">Words?</td>', 'Words?', '2004-07-14 14:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(811240, 91032, 7322, '<td valign="top">Did anybody read the challenge guidelines for this one? WHERE ARE THE WORDS? <br/> <br/></td>', 'Did anybody read the challenge guidelines for this one? WHERE ARE THE WORDS?  ', '2004-07-14 14:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(811241, 89484, 21478, '<td valign="top">I guess those are tweezers holding the paper (nice focus and depth of field by the way), but some more in the image to provide a perspective (on size), would add more context to this. Perhaps also with a magnifying glass over the tweezers, and even smaller text...</td>', 'I guess those are tweezers holding the paper (nice focus and depth of field by the way), but some more in the image to provide a perspective (on size), would add more context to this. Perhaps also with a magnifying glass over the tweezers, and even smaller text...', '2004-07-14 14:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(811243, 89971, 19751, '<td valign="top">something looks funny with the letters. it almost looks like a picture of a TV</td>', 'something looks funny with the letters. it almost looks like a picture of a TV', '2004-07-14 14:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(811244, 90926, 22922, '<td valign="top">But why is this *your* photo?  You need to be more creative, this is just a picture of someone else''s art.  The top edge is very bright and fuzzy, be careful to prevent wash out in full sunlight.</td>', 'But why is this *your* photo?  You need to be more creative, this is just a picture of someone else''s art.  The top edge is very bright and fuzzy, be careful to prevent wash out in full sunlight.', '2004-07-14 14:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(811245, 91032, 21478, '<td valign="top">Where are the words?</td>', 'Where are the words?', '2004-07-14 14:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(811246, 89929, 20115, '<td valign="top">very funny -- ditto for me</td>', 'very funny -- ditto for me', '2004-07-14 14:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(811247, 90337, 21478, '<td valign="top">There is a kind of haze in the shadow area between the lower two stacks of boxes that makes this look shot through a window? I would like to see a crisper image, and perhaps less depth of field (or something to remove the top left corner of grass/brush). Perhaps a tighter crop?</td>', 'There is a kind of haze in the shadow area between the lower two stacks of boxes that makes this look shot through a window? I would like to see a crisper image, and perhaps less depth of field (or something to remove the top left corner of grass/brush). Perhaps a tighter crop?', '2004-07-14 14:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(811249, 89929, 19751, '<td valign="top">hahhhahahahaha</td>', 'hahhhahahahaha', '2004-07-14 14:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(811253, 91043, 19751, '<td valign="top">boooo</td>', 'boooo', '2004-07-14 14:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(811254, 89971, 21478, '<td valign="top">This looks blurry (perhaps a crop from a larger image?), and a little "blown out" at the top. Good concept though. Perhaps cropping the right hand blue material would have balanced this out a bit more.</td>', 'This looks blurry (perhaps a crop from a larger image?), and a little "blown out" at the top. Good concept though. Perhaps cropping the right hand blue material would have balanced this out a bit more.', '2004-07-14 14:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(811255, 90196, 21478, '<td valign="top">Nice light work.</td>', 'Nice light work.', '2004-07-14 14:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(811256, 90408, 21478, '<td valign="top">I think you could crop the bottom third of this image to remove the trash can itself. Not really necessary for us to get the joke, and would get viewer to focus more on sign and cat.</td>', 'I think you could crop the bottom third of this image to remove the trash can itself. Not really necessary for us to get the joke, and would get viewer to focus more on sign and cat.', '2004-07-14 14:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(811258, 90840, 21478, '<td valign="top">I guess there are words on the street sign at the left of the image - but the idea of this competition was to have words as the focus. This seems like a snapshot of a dirty bus.</td>', 'I guess there are words on the street sign at the left of the image - but the idea of this competition was to have words as the focus. This seems like a snapshot of a dirty bus.', '2004-07-14 14:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(811259, 91096, 21478, '<td valign="top">Where are the words?</td>', 'Where are the words?', '2004-07-14 14:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(811261, 91094, 19751, '<td valign="top">a little crooked, but cute</td>', 'a little crooked, but cute', '2004-07-14 14:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(811264, 90025, 21478, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and scenery. A little to much shadow on the mountainside - but I guess there wasn''t much you could do about that! ;-)</td>', 'Nice composition and scenery. A little to much shadow on the mountainside - but I guess there wasn''t much you could do about that! ;-)', '2004-07-14 14:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
