(811340, 89971, 23394, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what is going on with this picture.  The image resolution is too low.  Even though there are words in the photo, I''m not sure how they relate to the challenge.</td>', 'I can''t tell what is going on with this picture.  The image resolution is too low.  Even though there are words in the photo, I''m not sure how they relate to the challenge.', '2004-07-14 15:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(811348, 89983, 23394, '<td valign="top">I see words, but the picture itself doesn''t really tell me a story.  Midday shots are difficult enough without filters or underexposing.  Maybe some additional elements to the picture would make it more of a photograph and less of a snapshot.</td>', 'I see words, but the picture itself doesn''t really tell me a story.  Midday shots are difficult enough without filters or underexposing.  Maybe some additional elements to the picture would make it more of a photograph and less of a snapshot.', '2004-07-14 15:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(811349, 89406, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great sign!  This would be a good entry at www.signspotting.com!  My only complaint about the shot is the rather blown-out sky in the upper left... but a cool shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Great sign!  This would be a good entry at www.signspotting.com!  My only complaint about the shot is the rather blown-out sky in the upper left... but a cool shot nonetheless.', '2004-07-14 15:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(811351, 91158, 23394, '<td valign="top">The lighting and soft focus hurt this picture.  Too bad you could capture the subjects holding hands...that would have tied in with the banner.</td>', 'The lighting and soft focus hurt this picture.  Too bad you could capture the subjects holding hands...that would have tied in with the banner.', '2004-07-14 15:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(811352, 91050, 23394, '<td valign="top">Focus and bobble make this image difficult for me.  It takes a lot of practice to get this type of shot just right.</td>', 'Focus and bobble make this image difficult for me.  It takes a lot of practice to get this type of shot just right.', '2004-07-14 15:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(811353, 90840, 23394, '<td valign="top">where are the words?</td>', 'where are the words?', '2004-07-14 15:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(811354, 90240, 23394, '<td valign="top">This could be an interesting shot, but I''m having a hard time stretching ''words'' to unfocused book pages.</td>', 'This could be an interesting shot, but I''m having a hard time stretching ''words'' to unfocused book pages.', '2004-07-14 15:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(811356, 91149, 23394, '<td valign="top">not sure what you are conveying here.  I do believe, though, the box itself could be used as an interesting prop with other elements, different angles, and different lighting.  keep on shooting!</td>', 'not sure what you are conveying here.  I do believe, though, the box itself could be used as an interesting prop with other elements, different angles, and different lighting.  keep on shooting!', '2004-07-14 15:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
