(811365, 91090, 23394, '<td valign="top">I see a nice snapshot of Air Force One.  Maybe from a different angle, this picture could grab my attention and tell me something.</td>', 'I see a nice snapshot of Air Force One.  Maybe from a different angle, this picture could grab my attention and tell me something.', '2004-07-14 15:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
