(811374, 91052, 21084, '<td valign="top">The picture looked great as a thumbprint - but loses focus when shown in full, wich is a pity as it really fits the challenge and was obviously well thought out. dropped from a 8/10 to a 6/10 - sorry!</td>', 'The picture looked great as a thumbprint - but loses focus when shown in full, wich is a pity as it really fits the challenge and was obviously well thought out. dropped from a 8/10 to a 6/10 - sorry!', '2004-07-14 15:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
