(811687, 90460, 21362, '<td valign="top">I like this except for the white. Too much contrast between the frogs and the white background. Good composition. Great idea.</td>', 'I like this except for the white. Too much contrast between the frogs and the white background. Good composition. Great idea.', '2004-07-14 17:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
