(811764, 91042, 22262, '<td valign="top">I think I understand what you are trying to say here, perhaps it would be better if this were on a tombstone and it encluded the words "Beloved Husband" or something like that.  It is a very lovey picture, I like the water drops on the flower and the tight foucs, but I have to take points off for no words.</td>', 'I think I understand what you are trying to say here, perhaps it would be better if this were on a tombstone and it encluded the words "Beloved Husband" or something like that.  It is a very lovey picture, I like the water drops on the flower and the tight foucs, but I have to take points off for no words.', '2004-07-14 18:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(811774, 91056, 22262, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but it might look better if you croped to get in tighter on the pictures and things.  Perhaps a backdrop of some kind. ( I went to a fabric store and got some remnents for cheap just for that)</td>', 'Good idea, but it might look better if you croped to get in tighter on the pictures and things.  Perhaps a backdrop of some kind. ( I went to a fabric store and got some remnents for cheap just for that)', '2004-07-14 18:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(811780, 90677, 1922, '<td valign="top">Great color in the sky. Nice photo.</td>', 'Great color in the sky. Nice photo.', '2004-07-14 18:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(811781, 91096, 22046, '<td valign="top">While this is a nice picture it totally misses the topic of the challenge. I have to give it a lower rating than I would if it fit the theme. It is supposed to have words showing in the picture. Nice  catch of an interesting bug. I am giving it a 4 because it does not fit the theme.</td>', 'While this is a nice picture it totally misses the topic of the challenge. I have to give it a lower rating than I would if it fit the theme. It is supposed to have words showing in the picture. Nice  catch of an interesting bug. I am giving it a 4 because it does not fit the theme.', '2004-07-14 19:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(811782, 91187, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting image. Can''t wait for the tutorial to see how you did it within the rules. I like the large dark space at the bottom but might have cropped it a little differently to move the subject down into it a bit more. Just my opinion.</td>', 'This is a really interesting image. Can''t wait for the tutorial to see how you did it within the rules. I like the large dark space at the bottom but might have cropped it a little differently to move the subject down into it a bit more. Just my opinion.', '2004-07-14 19:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(811784, 91031, 20679, '<td valign="top">angels crossing? Interesting picture!</td>', 'angels crossing? Interesting picture!', '2004-07-14 19:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(811788, 91014, 16917, '<td valign="top">i like this but its an idea that''s been done so many time, so im afraid it lost points for originality :( (6)</td>', 'i like this but its an idea that''s been done so many time, so im afraid it lost points for originality :( (6)', '2004-07-14 19:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(811790, 90391, 20679, '<td valign="top">tells a story - nice</td>', 'tells a story - nice', '2004-07-14 19:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(811791, 91098, 16917, '<td valign="top">i liked the way this was shot, even if i thought it was too sappy - call me a cynic or whatever but still, nice shot :)</td>', 'i liked the way this was shot, even if i thought it was too sappy - call me a cynic or whatever but still, nice shot :)', '2004-07-14 19:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(811792, 90751, 22046, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent portrait. The depth of field is perfect  so we see the child''s face and the letters sharp and clear. I like your choice of black and white for this. I expect that color might have taken away from the graphic simplicity of this. My favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'This is an excellent portrait. The depth of field is perfect  so we see the child''s face and the letters sharp and clear. I like your choice of black and white for this. I expect that color might have taken away from the graphic simplicity of this. My favorite in the challenge.', '2004-07-14 19:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(811794, 91015, 16917, '<td valign="top">simple, nicely shot version of a classic pair of words. Great. (9)</td>', 'simple, nicely shot version of a classic pair of words. Great. (9)', '2004-07-14 19:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(811797, 91187, 15580, '<td valign="top">****"I didn''t photoshop the words in.<br/>I used a black backdrop with the words taped on with regular masking tape.<br/>I then set my camera to do 3 strobe flashes in a pitch black room..<br/>the parts of the words that are captured are from those 3 strobes.<br/>I have sent the original photo to the admins so they can validate..<br/>Sorry if it seemed fake, but its really one picture..<br/>Mark"****<br/> <br/>I am real sorry about referring your image fo DQ, and so here is the truth!</td>', '****"I didn''t photoshop the words in.I used a black backdrop with the words taped on with regular masking tape.I then set my camera to do 3 strobe flashes in a pitch black room..the parts of the words that are captured are from those 3 strobes.I have sent the original photo to the admins so they can validate..Sorry if it seemed fake, but its really one picture..Mark"**** I am real sorry about referring your image fo DQ, and so here is the truth!', '2004-07-14 19:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
