(811979, 90821, 23454, '<td valign="top"><b><i>My voting guidelines for this competiton:</i></b> <br/> <br/><b>Does the photo meet the challenge (does the photo contain words): 1-NO, 2-YES</b> <br/>2-YES<br/> <br/><b>If you were to remove the words from the photo, is the photo itself interesting: 0-NO, 1-SOMEWHAT, 2-YES, 3-DEFINITELY</b> <br/>0-NO<br/> <br/><b>The quality of the actual photograph: 0-NEEDS WORK, 1-GOOD, 2-GREAT, 3-SUPERB</b> <br/>1-GOOD<br/> <br/><b>Does this picture WOW me: 0-NO, 1-YES, 2-DEFINITELY</b> <br/>2-DEFINITELY<br/> <br/><b>Total Score:</b> 5</td>', 'My voting guidelines for this competiton:  Does the photo meet the challenge (does the photo contain words): 1-NO, 2-YES 2-YES If you were to remove the words from the photo, is the photo itself interesting: 0-NO, 1-SOMEWHAT, 2-YES, 3-DEFINITELY 0-NO The quality of the actual photograph: 0-NEEDS WORK, 1-GOOD, 2-GREAT, 3-SUPERB 1-GOOD Does this picture WOW me: 0-NO, 1-YES, 2-DEFINITELY 2-DEFINITELY Total Score: 5', '2004-07-14 21:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(811982, 90859, 23899, '<td valign="top">Scary picture. dont like cementeries. I know Ill be one day in one of those one day.  the picture is well taked nice DOF and is very crisp shoot. but there is to many alredy. next time try to think about something that nobody has shoot. if you do something like this it has to be some out of normal. try to be more Original on your ideas. Good luck for next the next challenge. please dont shoot another cementery for the chocolatte contest.</td>', 'Scary picture. dont like cementeries. I know Ill be one day in one of those one day.  the picture is well taked nice DOF and is very crisp shoot. but there is to many alredy. next time try to think about something that nobody has shoot. if you do something like this it has to be some out of normal. try to be more Original on your ideas. Good luck for next the next challenge. please dont shoot another cementery for the chocolatte contest.', '2004-07-14 21:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
