(812286, 91100, 22922, '<td valign="top">This seems like a last minute idea, but qualifies for the challenge.  A simple improvement could have made this a contender: Print the words in a cursive or archaic font from your computer instead of writing in marker.</td>', 'This seems like a last minute idea, but qualifies for the challenge.  A simple improvement could have made this a contender: Print the words in a cursive or archaic font from your computer instead of writing in marker.', '2004-07-14 23:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
