(812331, 89774, 23454, '<td valign="top"><b><i>My voting guidelines for this competiton:</i></b> <br/> <br/><b>Does the photo meet the challenge (does the photo contain words): 1-NO, 2-YES</b> <br/>2-YES<br/> <br/><b>If you were to remove the words from the photo, is the photo itself interesting: 0-NO, 1-SOMEWHAT, 2-YES, 3-DEFINITELY</b> <br/>2-YES<br/> <br/><b>The quality of the actual photograph: 0-NEEDS WORK, 1-GOOD, 2-GREAT, 3-SUPERB</b> <br/>2-GREAT<br/> <br/><b>Does this picture WOW me: 0-NO, 1-YES, 2-DEFINITELY</b> <br/>1-YES<br/> <br/><b>Total Score:</b> 7<br/> <br/><b>Comments:</b> The creases in the Marriage Certificate are very distracting.</td>', 'My voting guidelines for this competiton:  Does the photo meet the challenge (does the photo contain words): 1-NO, 2-YES 2-YES If you were to remove the words from the photo, is the photo itself interesting: 0-NO, 1-SOMEWHAT, 2-YES, 3-DEFINITELY 2-YES The quality of the actual photograph: 0-NEEDS WORK, 1-GOOD, 2-GREAT, 3-SUPERB 2-GREAT Does this picture WOW me: 0-NO, 1-YES, 2-DEFINITELY 1-YES Total Score: 7 Comments: The creases in the Marriage Certificate are very distracting.', '2004-07-14 23:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
