(812495, 91117, 19708, '<td valign="top">Stunning composition. - GOOD EYE!<br/>Colors &amp; subject really draw the eye ito this shot.<br/>One small suggestion: If you can ever re-shoot this, get it when there isn''t a car''s reflection in the window. I disregarded it completely in this challenge.<br/>A wel deserved ((9)), and one of my favorites in this challenge!<br/></td>', 'Stunning composition. - GOOD EYE!Colors & subject really draw the eye ito this shot.One small suggestion: If you can ever re-shoot this, get it when there isn''t a car''s reflection in the window. I disregarded it completely in this challenge.A wel deserved ((9)), and one of my favorites in this challenge!', '2004-07-15 02:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(812498, 90754, 19708, '<td valign="top">Focus &amp; sharpness is way off on this.<br/>I didn''t really see any imagination / composition in this shot. Simply taking a picture of someone''s business sign really isn''t a plus for your shot.<br/>Had there been a rush of people going in/out (long exposure) or something to go along with the image to help the composition, it would have done a lot better in my opinion.</td>', 'Focus & sharpness is way off on this.I didn''t really see any imagination / composition in this shot. Simply taking a picture of someone''s business sign really isn''t a plus for your shot.Had there been a rush of people going in/out (long exposure) or something to go along with the image to help the composition, it would have done a lot better in my opinion.', '2004-07-15 02:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(812515, 89844, 16230, '<td valign="top">"in bed" :)<br/> <br/>Great idea! I think the focus looks a tiny bit soft though. I think it would look better if you couldn''t see the texture in the background material.<br/></td>', '"in bed" :) Great idea! I think the focus looks a tiny bit soft though. I think it would look better if you couldn''t see the texture in the background material.', '2004-07-15 03:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
