(812576, 89875, 15199, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and very nice lighting. The cookie is not very clear unfortunately. Maybe a ring would have made more impact.</td>', 'Nice idea and very nice lighting. The cookie is not very clear unfortunately. Maybe a ring would have made more impact.', '2004-07-15 05:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(812577, 89865, 15199, '<td valign="top">Good composition and the bird makes a nice photo balance. Yet unsure of the meaning of the end. (end of what?)</td>', 'Good composition and the bird makes a nice photo balance. Yet unsure of the meaning of the end. (end of what?)', '2004-07-15 06:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(812578, 90119, 15199, '<td valign="top">A bit more work would have made a better picture. Even a bit of rotation would have removed the tilting.</td>', 'A bit more work would have made a better picture. Even a bit of rotation would have removed the tilting.', '2004-07-15 06:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(812579, 91074, 15199, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Maybe more features or a bluer sky would have emphasised the large sky expense.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Maybe more features or a bluer sky would have emphasised the large sky expense.', '2004-07-15 06:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(812580, 91069, 15199, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, I do think a bit more depth of field would have aided this. Also the color of the carpet does make the picture flatter. Maybe a black carpet would have made more impact.</td>', 'Interesting idea, I do think a bit more depth of field would have aided this. Also the color of the carpet does make the picture flatter. Maybe a black carpet would have made more impact.', '2004-07-15 06:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(812581, 90746, 15199, '<td valign="top">Quite overexposed, removing the impact of the event. Interesting idea though.</td>', 'Quite overexposed, removing the impact of the event. Interesting idea though.', '2004-07-15 06:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(812582, 89905, 15199, '<td valign="top">I am not sure about the meaning of the picture. 40% off the pavement?</td>', 'I am not sure about the meaning of the picture. 40% off the pavement?', '2004-07-15 06:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(812583, 90545, 15199, '<td valign="top">I find the text a tad too small. Nice backdrop and color scheme.</td>', 'I find the text a tad too small. Nice backdrop and color scheme.', '2004-07-15 06:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(812584, 90164, 15199, '<td valign="top">More composition would have made more impact. Also the front light source (flash) detract from an expression of helplessness that the sign portrays.</td>', 'More composition would have made more impact. Also the front light source (flash) detract from an expression of helplessness that the sign portrays.', '2004-07-15 06:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(812585, 90302, 15199, '<td valign="top">Where are the words? Nice effect yet not sure what is all means?</td>', 'Where are the words? Nice effect yet not sure what is all means?', '2004-07-15 06:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(812586, 90752, 16493, '<td valign="top">very nice but needs more light - too much noise.</td>', 'very nice but needs more light - too much noise.', '2004-07-15 06:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(812587, 90359, 15199, '<td valign="top">A more original selection of words would have made more impact. Good composition though.</td>', 'A more original selection of words would have made more impact. Good composition though.', '2004-07-15 06:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(812588, 90052, 15199, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. Blue light does not really work (no blue lights in the morning).</td>', 'I like this shot. Blue light does not really work (no blue lights in the morning).', '2004-07-15 06:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(812589, 91082, 15199, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, The flower does seem a bit out of place. Interesting composition.</td>', 'Nice idea, The flower does seem a bit out of place. Interesting composition.', '2004-07-15 06:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(812590, 90344, 16493, '<td valign="top">The background takes a bit away from the word soup, spoon adds nothing to the composition.</td>', 'The background takes a bit away from the word soup, spoon adds nothing to the composition.', '2004-07-15 06:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(812591, 90751, 15199, '<td valign="top">Great compsosition. Pity about the light from the right top, overshining the table. Lovely shadows on the child.</td>', 'Great compsosition. Pity about the light from the right top, overshining the table. Lovely shadows on the child.', '2004-07-15 06:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(812593, 91001, 15199, '<td valign="top">Mental Asylum? The white is a bit overexposed, good character balance though.</td>', 'Mental Asylum? The white is a bit overexposed, good character balance though.', '2004-07-15 06:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(812594, 91189, 22011, '<td valign="top">Very neat, is the rock etched?   The highlights are a little distracting, but I assume this is outdoors so you''d have a bit of trouble fixing them.  Well done..</td>', 'Very neat, is the rock etched?   The highlights are a little distracting, but I assume this is outdoors so you''d have a bit of trouble fixing them.  Well done..', '2004-07-15 06:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(812595, 90752, 22011, '<td valign="top">I gather this message isn''t meant for me?  The focus seems a little soft, but that''s what you may have been going for?</td>', 'I gather this message isn''t meant for me?  The focus seems a little soft, but that''s what you may have been going for?', '2004-07-15 06:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(812596, 91042, 22011, '<td valign="top">OK, I''ve cut a lot of slack to flower photos, as I''m a bit partial to a nice bloom, but I''ll just have to go with what I imagine is the bulk of the voters on this one, and say it dosn''t even come close to meeting the challenge.</td>', 'OK, I''ve cut a lot of slack to flower photos, as I''m a bit partial to a nice bloom, but I''ll just have to go with what I imagine is the bulk of the voters on this one, and say it dosn''t even come close to meeting the challenge.', '2004-07-15 06:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(812597, 90726, 22011, '<td valign="top">Ummmm,  Wow.  The end of the book with the crease it in of course means that this is not perfect :-).  Having said that, this is probably the best photo I''ve seen on DPC.  Great composition, great idea, well exposed, yada yada yada.. Well done.<br/> <br/>I''ve got to get me one of those models...</td>', 'Ummmm,  Wow.  The end of the book with the crease it in of course means that this is not perfect :-).  Having said that, this is probably the best photo I''ve seen on DPC.  Great composition, great idea, well exposed, yada yada yada.. Well done. I''ve got to get me one of those models...', '2004-07-15 06:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(812599, 90590, 22011, '<td valign="top">This looks a little under exposed / under saturated.  Is that because you didn''t want to stay long enough for a longer exposure? :-).  When shooting predominantly white/light coloured surfaces you generally need to compenstage +.5 to 1 stop as the camera will read the ''average'' light level to be quite high, and underexpose the shot.  That might be what happened here?</td>', 'This looks a little under exposed / under saturated.  Is that because you didn''t want to stay long enough for a longer exposure? :-).  When shooting predominantly white/light coloured surfaces you generally need to compenstage +.5 to 1 stop as the camera will read the ''average'' light level to be quite high, and underexpose the shot.  That might be what happened here?', '2004-07-15 06:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(812600, 90008, 22011, '<td valign="top">Words, yes...  But you could have had some in focus...  Some digital cameras wont focus well on a PC monitor, try putting something black down the center of the screen like a black ruler..  You half-press the shutter to get the camera to focus and meter the image, whip out the ruler then to the full press of the shutter to take the photo.  It should have focused more closely on the surface of the screen that it apperas you got here...</td>', 'Words, yes...  But you could have had some in focus...  Some digital cameras wont focus well on a PC monitor, try putting something black down the center of the screen like a black ruler..  You half-press the shutter to get the camera to focus and meter the image, whip out the ruler then to the full press of the shutter to take the photo.  It should have focused more closely on the surface of the screen that it apperas you got here...', '2004-07-15 06:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(812601, 91061, 22011, '<td valign="top">Look like you''ve got a little bit of motion blur on the in focus lego ''bumps''.  Self-timer and a tripod/stack of books, lump of silly putty would help if that''s the case..  If it''s not motion blur, ignore me :-).</td>', 'Look like you''ve got a little bit of motion blur on the in focus lego ''bumps''.  Self-timer and a tripod/stack of books, lump of silly putty would help if that''s the case..  If it''s not motion blur, ignore me :-).', '2004-07-15 06:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(812602, 89905, 22011, '<td valign="top">This appears to be a little over-exposed to me, along the bottom edge of the card particularly.</td>', 'This appears to be a little over-exposed to me, along the bottom edge of the card particularly.', '2004-07-15 06:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(812603, 90198, 22011, '<td valign="top">I think this image is suffering from excessive jpeg compression syndrome...  The allowable size is 150kb, but you''ve only used a 20k image, so I imagine you could have got a great deal more clarity in this image, which would have helped your score a bit, as it''s an interesting looking building, with a good range of tones in the shot.</td>', 'I think this image is suffering from excessive jpeg compression syndrome...  The allowable size is 150kb, but you''ve only used a 20k image, so I imagine you could have got a great deal more clarity in this image, which would have helped your score a bit, as it''s an interesting looking building, with a good range of tones in the shot.', '2004-07-15 06:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(812604, 91036, 22011, '<td valign="top">Great contrast, and some chaps in a small boat about to have trouble crossing the wake of the liner!</td>', 'Great contrast, and some chaps in a small boat about to have trouble crossing the wake of the liner!', '2004-07-15 07:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(812605, 89863, 22011, '<td valign="top">That is a neat sculpture, I was about to type here that you''d flipped/mirrored the image, then I reaslised what the big read thing was..  Well framed, and the exposure great for an object in shadow on a bright day.</td>', 'That is a neat sculpture, I was about to type here that you''d flipped/mirrored the image, then I reaslised what the big read thing was..  Well framed, and the exposure great for an object in shadow on a bright day.', '2004-07-15 07:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(812609, 90253, 20853, '<td valign="top">Oops!  I first thought the R was a K!  Creative!</td>', 'Oops!  I first thought the R was a K!  Creative!', '2004-07-15 07:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(812611, 91058, 20407, '<td valign="top">This photo would have been excellent if the box wasn''t in the ground underneath. Pretty cool - looks like you can do it again - you should have a go :)</td>', 'This photo would have been excellent if the box wasn''t in the ground underneath. Pretty cool - looks like you can do it again - you should have a go :)', '2004-07-15 07:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
