(812696, 90864, 12825, '<td valign="top">Nice photo -- it appears a little blown out though -- over-exposed -- I would have liked to be able to clearly see the text of the certificate.</td>', 'Nice photo -- it appears a little blown out though -- over-exposed -- I would have liked to be able to clearly see the text of the certificate.', '2004-07-15 11:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(812699, 91121, 12825, '<td valign="top">Good idea!  Nice photo.  There are some visible JPEG compression articfacts in the shot though, and I noticed your file size is just 72 KB.  Try fine-tuning your final process so that you get the highest quality JPEG possible, while still weighing in at under 150 KB (the site limit).</td>', 'Good idea!  Nice photo.  There are some visible JPEG compression articfacts in the shot though, and I noticed your file size is just 72 KB.  Try fine-tuning your final process so that you get the highest quality JPEG possible, while still weighing in at under 150 KB (the site limit).', '2004-07-15 11:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
