(812723, 90302, 19608, '<td valign="top">This is a very intriguing image that would do well in a challenge where it was within  the theme of the challenge.  If there are words somewhere - they are so hidden they are not a part of the composition.</td>', 'This is a very intriguing image that would do well in a challenge where it was within  the theme of the challenge.  If there are words somewhere - they are so hidden they are not a part of the composition.', '2004-07-15 11:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
