(813090, 91098, 22011, '<td valign="top">Oooo, that was close to a flower shot...  Some people just can''t help themselves :-).</td>', 'Oooo, that was close to a flower shot...  Some people just can''t help themselves :-).', '2004-07-15 17:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
