(813099, 89976, 22011, '<td valign="top">Yow, that''s a bold red on my monitor, I assume that you knocked upthe saturation a bit?  A very dramatic effect in this case...</td>', 'Yow, that''s a bold red on my monitor, I assume that you knocked upthe saturation a bit?  A very dramatic effect in this case...', '2004-07-15 17:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(813104, 90160, 22011, '<td valign="top">Now that''s grafitti..  I went looking for some in town, but could only find some felt pen marks on the rugby stadium wall..  I think we''re a tad too rural for good street art.  Well captured, although I''m not sure the child adds anything but scale to the picture in this case.</td>', 'Now that''s grafitti..  I went looking for some in town, but could only find some felt pen marks on the rugby stadium wall..  I think we''re a tad too rural for good street art.  Well captured, although I''m not sure the child adds anything but scale to the picture in this case.', '2004-07-15 17:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(813109, 90610, 22011, '<td valign="top">:-).  It''s amazing the lengths folks will go to slip in a flower shot..  This is really neat, although I think I would have prefered the intact rose to be comming up from below, it looks somehow odd upside down.</td>', ':-).  It''s amazing the lengths folks will go to slip in a flower shot..  This is really neat, although I think I would have prefered the intact rose to be comming up from below, it looks somehow odd upside down.', '2004-07-15 17:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
