(813111, 89865, 22011, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the bird really belongs in this shot, it detracts from the simplicity a bit..  Really neat idea, and crisply executed.  Well done.</td>', 'Not sure if the bird really belongs in this shot, it detracts from the simplicity a bit..  Really neat idea, and crisply executed.  Well done.', '2004-07-15 17:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
