(815020, 91074, 20613, '<td valign="top">This is probably my favorite photograph in the challenge.<br/>As silly as this may sounds, it makes me feel as if I''m flying; I love it!  You''ve definitely got a 10 from me.  Also, the sky looks so beautiful in this photo.  Truly amazing job!</td>', 'This is probably my favorite photograph in the challenge.As silly as this may sounds, it makes me feel as if I''m flying; I love it!  You''ve definitely got a 10 from me.  Also, the sky looks so beautiful in this photo.  Truly amazing job!', '2004-07-17 15:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
