(815632, 90424, 19519, '<td valign="top">This is rather humorous!  I like the irony of it, nicely done!</td>', 'This is rather humorous!  I like the irony of it, nicely done!', '2004-07-18 11:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(815633, 90648, 19519, '<td valign="top">That is funny!  Although without the title, I think that it would take viewers a little while to see the small sticker, the composition doesn''t seem to draw your eye to the sticker.</td>', 'That is funny!  Although without the title, I think that it would take viewers a little while to see the small sticker, the composition doesn''t seem to draw your eye to the sticker.', '2004-07-18 11:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(815634, 90866, 19519, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  I like how you did the background, I think that it sets off the remote well.  Interesting choice of subject.</td>', 'Nice photo.  I like how you did the background, I think that it sets off the remote well.  Interesting choice of subject.', '2004-07-18 11:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(815636, 90839, 19519, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Good concept, and laid out well.  Maybe a little more focus throughout would have made this image even more powerful.</td>', 'Nice!  Good concept, and laid out well.  Maybe a little more focus throughout would have made this image even more powerful.', '2004-07-18 11:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(815637, 90063, 19519, '<td valign="top">interesting choice of subject, nice dof, but maybe a little drab, although I don''t know what I would have done with it.  The title, in this case, helps a lot with explaining the photo.</td>', 'interesting choice of subject, nice dof, but maybe a little drab, although I don''t know what I would have done with it.  The title, in this case, helps a lot with explaining the photo.', '2004-07-18 11:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(815638, 90586, 19519, '<td valign="top">Very interesting!  I love how you did this!  The only thing that I would change is maybe a little more light on the face with the gold paint.</td>', 'Very interesting!  I love how you did this!  The only thing that I would change is maybe a little more light on the face with the gold paint.', '2004-07-18 11:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(815639, 89774, 19519, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Maybe move the rings over to the left a bit, so they are not covered by the flowers, other than that, great job!</td>', 'Nicely done.  Maybe move the rings over to the left a bit, so they are not covered by the flowers, other than that, great job!', '2004-07-18 11:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(815641, 91027, 19519, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect, I wonder how it was done.  You will have to let us in on your methodology.  I think that this could be strengthened by adding more stars in the background, other than that, nice job!</td>', 'Interesting effect, I wonder how it was done.  You will have to let us in on your methodology.  I think that this could be strengthened by adding more stars in the background, other than that, nice job!', '2004-07-18 11:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(815643, 90850, 19519, '<td valign="top">Ha ha!  Not bad, but I think that the composition needs some work, it feels a bit off somehow.  Different framing I think.</td>', 'Ha ha!  Not bad, but I think that the composition needs some work, it feels a bit off somehow.  Different framing I think.', '2004-07-18 11:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
