(816104, 91035, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nicely done...like the sign and the money in the cap is a nice touch.  I do have to add that IMHO it looks set-up, in that the box he''s sitting on is clean and the clothing is also clean and neatly pressed.  The shoes only have minor scuffing.  I could be all wrong and you could have found a decently-dressed, clean, neat homeless kid.  Anyway, it''s a well-executed idea, could have a bit more impact if he were more "weathered."  :o)</td>', 'Nicely done...like the sign and the money in the cap is a nice touch.  I do have to add that IMHO it looks set-up, in that the box he''s sitting on is clean and the clothing is also clean and neatly pressed.  The shoes only have minor scuffing.  I could be all wrong and you could have found a decently-dressed, clean, neat homeless kid.  Anyway, it''s a well-executed idea, could have a bit more impact if he were more "weathered."  :o)', '2004-07-18 22:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(816106, 91105, 18349, '<td valign="top">Of all the building shots, this is my favorite.  I love the architecture, the right angles, the textures of the brick and the steel.  The yellow around the window really sets it off.  The words aren''t really a major part of the shot, but they add to the industrial feel of the image.  Well done, regardless of how many "doesn''t meet the challenge" comments you get.</td>', 'Of all the building shots, this is my favorite.  I love the architecture, the right angles, the textures of the brick and the steel.  The yellow around the window really sets it off.  The words aren''t really a major part of the shot, but they add to the industrial feel of the image.  Well done, regardless of how many "doesn''t meet the challenge" comments you get.', '2004-07-18 22:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(816107, 91117, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is really cool...would love to see more of the turquoise pop out at me.  Maybe a slight boost in sats or a curve adjustment?  Anyway, well-composed image.  :o)</td>', 'This is really cool...would love to see more of the turquoise pop out at me.  Maybe a slight boost in sats or a curve adjustment?  Anyway, well-composed image.  :o)', '2004-07-18 22:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
