(818592, 89850, 8860, '<td valign="top">Image suffers serious white balance problems. Faded look could be a number of things, but pointing your camera at a mid grey would help get the balance right when focusing. Lots of artifacts too. Not bad DOF though, so some strong lighting and contrast would help next time.</td>', 'Image suffers serious white balance problems. Faded look could be a number of things, but pointing your camera at a mid grey would help get the balance right when focusing. Lots of artifacts too. Not bad DOF though, so some strong lighting and contrast would help next time.', '2004-07-20 20:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(818595, 90434, 9232, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love the subject but the background is waaay to busy.  Creative composition with the hatch lifted in the back.</td>', 'Absolutely love the subject but the background is waaay to busy.  Creative composition with the hatch lifted in the back.', '2004-07-20 20:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(818598, 91096, 21978, '<td valign="top">Read the challenge again.</td>', 'Read the challenge again.', '2004-07-20 20:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(818599, 89853, 9232, '<td valign="top">I''ll have to admit that I thought this must be juvenile manipulation from the thumbnail of it but once I saw the strategic placement of the can and straw this jumped a couple of points in my evaluation.  Creative vision of a somewhat baser overall message.  Good job.</td>', 'I''ll have to admit that I thought this must be juvenile manipulation from the thumbnail of it but once I saw the strategic placement of the can and straw this jumped a couple of points in my evaluation.  Creative vision of a somewhat baser overall message.  Good job.', '2004-07-20 20:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(818604, 90131, 21978, '<td valign="top">But where are the words?</td>', 'But where are the words?', '2004-07-20 20:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(818607, 89940, 8860, '<td valign="top">Delightful textures and a nice take.</td>', 'Delightful textures and a nice take.', '2004-07-20 20:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(818609, 90839, 9232, '<td valign="top">Firstly this is an incredible composition given the topic.  You selected and composed this shot very well.  Sadly I think it would have benefited from more light to bring out the white of the page against the ivory of the keys and to brighten the tones in the fabric at the top of the shot.  I think you should take great pride in having an eye for this composition and the DOF you exhibited.  Very nice.  The one nit with how you laid it out is the words on what appears to be a sheet of paper on the far left of the image just under the sheet music.  The power of this shot is derived from the topic "Words" and your creative vision wherein the title of the music are the only words easily in focus for the viewer.  The other words just become slightly distracting.  Contrast this with the much smaller words both above and below the title; these are not distracting as they are almost unreadable.</td>', 'Firstly this is an incredible composition given the topic.  You selected and composed this shot very well.  Sadly I think it would have benefited from more light to bring out the white of the page against the ivory of the keys and to brighten the tones in the fabric at the top of the shot.  I think you should take great pride in having an eye for this composition and the DOF you exhibited.  Very nice.  The one nit with how you laid it out is the words on what appears to be a sheet of paper on the far left of the image just under the sheet music.  The power of this shot is derived from the topic "Words" and your creative vision wherein the title of the music are the only words easily in focus for the viewer.  The other words just become slightly distracting.  Contrast this with the much smaller words both above and below the title; these are not distracting as they are almost unreadable.', '2004-07-20 20:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(818611, 91032, 21978, '<td valign="top">Words?</td>', 'Words?', '2004-07-20 20:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(818612, 90726, 9232, '<td valign="top">Outstanding lighting.  I do hope you share your lighting and camera placement as well as the support(s) holding the book after the contest is over.  Very nice work.</td>', 'Outstanding lighting.  I do hope you share your lighting and camera placement as well as the support(s) holding the book after the contest is over.  Very nice work.', '2004-07-20 20:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(818614, 90508, 21978, '<td valign="top">The one and only!</td>', 'The one and only!', '2004-07-20 20:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(818616, 89743, 8860, '<td valign="top">Well, words fail me that''s for sure. Except to say that this deserves to win as an example of bravely excellent photojournalism and the words are all in the actions. Boy, am I lucky - this is tragic.</td>', 'Well, words fail me that''s for sure. Except to say that this deserves to win as an example of bravely excellent photojournalism and the words are all in the actions. Boy, am I lucky - this is tragic.', '2004-07-20 20:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(818619, 90340, 9232, '<td valign="top">I feel like you must be trying to say something here I just don''t understand what it is.  As an expressive piece I can see how it may have deep value for you but I just don''t seem to be getting it here.  The title "With Brightness of Peace" doesn''t seem to have any connection in my mind to the phrase written in the photograph "love is a place".  I can see how the feet might have some tie-in as they are how we are most often connected to places we travel but I think I must be failing to see the big picture.  I hope you''ll elaborate on this after the challenge either in your notes about the shot or with a PM.</td>', 'I feel like you must be trying to say something here I just don''t understand what it is.  As an expressive piece I can see how it may have deep value for you but I just don''t seem to be getting it here.  The title "With Brightness of Peace" doesn''t seem to have any connection in my mind to the phrase written in the photograph "love is a place".  I can see how the feet might have some tie-in as they are how we are most often connected to places we travel but I think I must be failing to see the big picture.  I hope you''ll elaborate on this after the challenge either in your notes about the shot or with a PM.', '2004-07-20 20:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(818621, 90726, 8860, '<td valign="top">Yann''s a hero. I don''t really like the manikin thing - it''s done to death, but this is quite well conceived and executed.</td>', 'Yann''s a hero. I don''t really like the manikin thing - it''s done to death, but this is quite well conceived and executed.', '2004-07-20 20:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(818624, 90334, 9232, '<td valign="top">I think just a tad more DOF would have helped this.  I think you exposed it well given the hot spot on the pliers/grips.  Not too hot and the gradiation from light to shadow on the strawberry is nice.</td>', 'I think just a tad more DOF would have helped this.  I think you exposed it well given the hot spot on the pliers/grips.  Not too hot and the gradiation from light to shadow on the strawberry is nice.', '2004-07-20 20:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(818625, 89844, 8860, '<td valign="top">Oh yes indeed!  :)</td>', 'Oh yes indeed!  :)', '2004-07-20 20:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(818627, 90261, 8860, '<td valign="top">Potent message. Nice shot, well lit and very crisp. Not creative but well presented.</td>', 'Potent message. Nice shot, well lit and very crisp. Not creative but well presented.', '2004-07-20 20:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(818628, 89865, 9232, '<td valign="top">Wow I wish this was an advanced challenge so you could clone out the bird and the sticker on the sign.  The sign with the expanse of sky as its setting is powerful enough, especially when coupled with the title.</td>', 'Wow I wish this was an advanced challenge so you could clone out the bird and the sticker on the sign.  The sign with the expanse of sky as its setting is powerful enough, especially when coupled with the title.', '2004-07-20 20:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(818629, 90993, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very simple but interesting.  Great macro shot; love the DOF and the color.  Nice interpretation of the challenge.  :o)</td>', 'Very simple but interesting.  Great macro shot; love the DOF and the color.  Nice interpretation of the challenge.  :o)', '2004-07-20 20:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(818630, 90333, 8860, '<td valign="top">I must be ignorant, but why is this scrawled here? Shot is OK but not very appealing.</td>', 'I must be ignorant, but why is this scrawled here? Shot is OK but not very appealing.', '2004-07-20 20:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(818631, 91149, 18349, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but quite small.  Crop is a bit off on the bottom left.  Would have preferred it to be a bit larger and cropped outside the E of Enjoy.  Good effort; with some minor adjustments would be very fitting.  :o)</td>', 'Interesting, but quite small.  Crop is a bit off on the bottom left.  Would have preferred it to be a bit larger and cropped outside the E of Enjoy.  Good effort; with some minor adjustments would be very fitting.  :o)', '2004-07-20 20:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(818633, 90261, 8891, '<td valign="top">The words are well shot and I like what they have to say. I would have not made such a dramatic crop as what there is of the wall has some very nice texture that might have been worth seeing more of.</td>', 'The words are well shot and I like what they have to say. I would have not made such a dramatic crop as what there is of the wall has some very nice texture that might have been worth seeing more of.', '2004-07-20 20:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(818634, 90337, 9232, '<td valign="top">Simply a great exposure; nice tones throughout the composition.  I personally wish that you''d cropped it just a hair higher at the bottom of the shot so as to cut off more of the box on the left and come closer to the bottom of the box in the center of the frame; the dark border under it with just a hint of light on what appears to be a horizontal surface is mildly distracting from the wood textures that dominate the rest of the shot in varying degrees of exposure.  You are to be commended for such an eye and such a composition.  Very good job.  The words are dark and readable and they create a theme throughout the shot that mimics the woodgrain texture.  Nice work.</td>', 'Simply a great exposure; nice tones throughout the composition.  I personally wish that you''d cropped it just a hair higher at the bottom of the shot so as to cut off more of the box on the left and come closer to the bottom of the box in the center of the frame; the dark border under it with just a hint of light on what appears to be a horizontal surface is mildly distracting from the wood textures that dominate the rest of the shot in varying degrees of exposure.  You are to be commended for such an eye and such a composition.  Very good job.  The words are dark and readable and they create a theme throughout the shot that mimics the woodgrain texture.  Nice work.', '2004-07-20 20:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(818635, 91061, 8891, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. The focus appears a bit off, but good idea and attempt.</td>', 'Nice macro. The focus appears a bit off, but good idea and attempt.', '2004-07-20 21:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(818636, 90677, 9232, '<td valign="top">So THAT''s where they live.  Whew!  Won''t the dragon be glad.  Now we can save the village.</td>', 'So THAT''s where they live.  Whew!  Won''t the dragon be glad.  Now we can save the village.', '2004-07-20 21:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(818639, 90176, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very cute idea...looks a bit underexposed or the white balance might be off...seems a bit "yellow."  Letters need a tad bit more sharpness...but overall a great effort.  :o)</td>', 'Very cute idea...looks a bit underexposed or the white balance might be off...seems a bit "yellow."  Letters need a tad bit more sharpness...but overall a great effort.  :o)', '2004-07-20 21:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(818643, 90600, 9232, '<td valign="top">I really think you had a great subject and a good eye for it initially.  I think this shot would have done better (IMO) as a square.  Try cropping it just above the white billboard and then make the height match the width and see how it looks.  I think it would make a fairly powerful statement with the deep cerulean sky just above the faded out words.</td>', 'I really think you had a great subject and a good eye for it initially.  I think this shot would have done better (IMO) as a square.  Try cropping it just above the white billboard and then make the height match the width and see how it looks.  I think it would make a fairly powerful statement with the deep cerulean sky just above the faded out words.', '2004-07-20 21:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(818648, 91014, 8860, '<td valign="top">Unoriginal (as everyone else will point out) but in it''s favour it is a well executed, good looking picture.</td>', 'Unoriginal (as everyone else will point out) but in it''s favour it is a well executed, good looking picture.', '2004-07-20 21:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(818649, 90816, 8891, '<td valign="top">ThThe macro drop and words are very well shot. Well done. I do think the frame diminishes the image somewhat, otherwise very good.</td>', 'ThThe macro drop and words are very well shot. Well done. I do think the frame diminishes the image somewhat, otherwise very good.', '2004-07-20 21:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(818659, 90494, 1368, '<td valign="top">awesome stuff - 10</td>', 'awesome stuff - 10', '2004-07-20 21:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(818662, 91058, 20395, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, clever title!  The box of biscuits is the brightest spot in the shot though, which draws a lot of attention. It might have been better without it.</td>', 'Cute idea, clever title!  The box of biscuits is the brightest spot in the shot though, which draws a lot of attention. It might have been better without it.', '2004-07-20 21:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(818664, 91036, 20395, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for humor like this. Very cute- you got me laughing!</td>', 'I''m a sucker for humor like this. Very cute- you got me laughing!', '2004-07-20 21:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(818670, 91074, 18933, '<td valign="top">very cleam - very simple</td>', 'very cleam - very simple', '2004-07-20 21:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(818674, 89853, 8891, '<td valign="top">Extremely clever and nicely shot AND funny as well!</td>', 'Extremely clever and nicely shot AND funny as well!', '2004-07-20 21:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(818679, 89875, 1368, '<td valign="top">this one is just too cute :)</td>', 'this one is just too cute :)', '2004-07-20 21:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(818680, 91105, 18933, '<td valign="top">good lines</td>', 'good lines', '2004-07-20 21:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(818681, 90021, 1368, '<td valign="top">It would have been a good thing to have a tripod so the picture would not have been so moved, good luck :)</td>', 'It would have been a good thing to have a tripod so the picture would not have been so moved, good luck :)', '2004-07-20 21:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(818684, 89993, 1368, '<td valign="top">I think more shadows could have worked better here to give the picture more depth</td>', 'I think more shadows could have worked better here to give the picture more depth', '2004-07-20 21:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(818685, 90559, 8891, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! Like the lighting, the premise, the model and pose. The vignette frame adds nothing to this image and is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nice shot! Like the lighting, the premise, the model and pose. The vignette frame adds nothing to this image and is a bit distracting.', '2004-07-20 21:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(818686, 89838, 1368, '<td valign="top">I think this is maybe a little bit too bright, I think a darker background could have worked well here to bring out the subject more</td>', 'I think this is maybe a little bit too bright, I think a darker background could have worked well here to bring out the subject more', '2004-07-20 21:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(818688, 89903, 1368, '<td valign="top">the picture has a yellow hue over it which could have been corrected with color balancing it, maybe you wanted it like this, but the lighting is a lieetle flat could maybe have been cool to use a flashlight to give it mysterious lighting</td>', 'the picture has a yellow hue over it which could have been corrected with color balancing it, maybe you wanted it like this, but the lighting is a lieetle flat could maybe have been cool to use a flashlight to give it mysterious lighting', '2004-07-20 21:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(818689, 90344, 2158, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but this would have worked far better with a plain tablecloth.</td>', 'I like the idea, but this would have worked far better with a plain tablecloth.', '2004-07-20 21:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(818694, 91086, 18933, '<td valign="top">nice line - maybe a different angle would spark iit</td>', 'nice line - maybe a different angle would spark iit', '2004-07-20 21:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(818695, 91118, 1368, '<td valign="top">this picture is very sweet I like the lighting on the rose with the words, very clever ;)</td>', 'this picture is very sweet I like the lighting on the rose with the words, very clever ;)', '2004-07-20 21:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(818715, 90633, 7152, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this picture and I''ve looked at it for a while, but I''m not sure how the word "off" is relevant in this picture.</td>', 'I like the colors in this picture and I''ve looked at it for a while, but I''m not sure how the word "off" is relevant in this picture.', '2004-07-20 22:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(818718, 91192, 7152, '<td valign="top">nice picture .. but I think the colors are a little weak .. try playing with brightness/contrast and some hue and saturation to make the colors more rich. (7)<br/></td>', 'nice picture .. but I think the colors are a little weak .. try playing with brightness/contrast and some hue and saturation to make the colors more rich. (7)', '2004-07-20 22:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(818719, 91090, 18933, '<td valign="top">very nice contrast</td>', 'very nice contrast', '2004-07-20 22:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(818720, 90609, 7152, '<td valign="top">not so fond memories of my calc. final come back to mind looking at this page .. nice picture and composition.</td>', 'not so fond memories of my calc. final come back to mind looking at this page .. nice picture and composition.', '2004-07-20 22:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(818724, 90176, 7152, '<td valign="top">hahah .. awesome and original idea .. if the lighting was better (not so yellow .. or more evenly lit) this would do really really well. Good job.</td>', 'hahah .. awesome and original idea .. if the lighting was better (not so yellow .. or more evenly lit) this would do really really well. Good job.', '2004-07-20 22:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(818725, 90859, 7152, '<td valign="top">wow .. this is probably the best shot I''ve seen so far .. but something about the picture is odd .. the whole picture looks like it has a sand texture to it.</td>', 'wow .. this is probably the best shot I''ve seen so far .. but something about the picture is odd .. the whole picture looks like it has a sand texture to it.', '2004-07-20 22:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(818727, 90864, 7152, '<td valign="top">very nice photo idea .. its a shame that the paper is over exposed</td>', 'very nice photo idea .. its a shame that the paper is over exposed', '2004-07-20 22:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(818729, 90810, 7152, '<td valign="top">nice picture .. but there are a lot of words .. and I''m not sure if I''m supposed to read all of them ... or just some .. so I have to say this is a little too busy and hard to understand.</td>', 'nice picture .. but there are a lot of words .. and I''m not sure if I''m supposed to read all of them ... or just some .. so I have to say this is a little too busy and hard to understand.', '2004-07-20 22:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(818731, 90632, 7152, '<td valign="top">nice idea .. but I think the composition could be better.</td>', 'nice idea .. but I think the composition could be better.', '2004-07-20 22:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(818735, 89838, 7152, '<td valign="top">wow .. I love this .. I really do ... people are probably going to complain that it''s too busy .. but I think if you take time to look at it anyone can appreciate it .. only complaint is that it''s maybe just a little too bright.</td>', 'wow .. I love this .. I really do ... people are probably going to complain that it''s too busy .. but I think if you take time to look at it anyone can appreciate it .. only complaint is that it''s maybe just a little too bright.', '2004-07-20 22:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(818736, 90157, 7152, '<td valign="top">I like the effect you''ve created ... not sure how you did it or if it was intentional.</td>', 'I like the effect you''ve created ... not sure how you did it or if it was intentional.', '2004-07-20 22:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(818739, 91035, 7152, '<td valign="top">great shot ..  I wonder how it would look if you hadn''t cropped out the rest of his left foot and the rest of the sign. (9)</td>', 'great shot ..  I wonder how it would look if you hadn''t cropped out the rest of his left foot and the rest of the sign. (9)', '2004-07-20 22:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(818740, 90987, 7152, '<td valign="top">nice lighing</td>', 'nice lighing', '2004-07-20 22:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(818743, 89993, 18349, '<td valign="top">Great idea, great shot...great googly moogly!  My top pick of this challenge.  :o)</td>', 'Great idea, great shot...great googly moogly!  My top pick of this challenge.  :o)', '2004-07-20 22:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(818744, 90358, 7152, '<td valign="top">wow .. this is such a nice picture .. but I dont find that the word "closed" in the window does much for me .... if you cloned out that word .... I would buy this picture.</td>', 'wow .. this is such a nice picture .. but I dont find that the word "closed" in the window does much for me .... if you cloned out that word .... I would buy this picture.', '2004-07-20 22:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(818745, 91044, 7152, '<td valign="top">hahah .. awesome idea  .. I love it.</td>', 'hahah .. awesome idea  .. I love it.', '2004-07-20 22:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(818746, 89844, 7152, '<td valign="top">Great idea (10)</td>', 'Great idea (10)', '2004-07-20 22:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(818747, 90716, 18349, '<td valign="top">Fabulous idea...technically sound image...perhaps the letters could be a bit more sharp, but outstanding entry nonetheless.  :o)</td>', 'Fabulous idea...technically sound image...perhaps the letters could be a bit more sharp, but outstanding entry nonetheless.  :o)', '2004-07-20 22:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(818748, 89976, 18349, '<td valign="top">Boy, that''s one bright building facade!  Interesting angle; sign adds just the right context for the angle as well.  Good shot.  :o)</td>', 'Boy, that''s one bright building facade!  Interesting angle; sign adds just the right context for the angle as well.  Good shot.  :o)', '2004-07-20 22:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(818751, 89863, 18349, '<td valign="top">Love this image.  Can''t imagine what it must be like in "real life."  Good photo; colors are crisp and focus is sharp.  Well done.  :o)</td>', 'Love this image.  Can''t imagine what it must be like in "real life."  Good photo; colors are crisp and focus is sharp.  Well done.  :o)', '2004-07-20 22:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(818755, 89929, 18349, '<td valign="top">Famous last words... LOL  ;o)<br/>Great idea; love the multi-colored inks on the paper.  Well done!  :o)</td>', 'Famous last words... LOL  ;o)Great idea; love the multi-colored inks on the paper.  Well done!  :o)', '2004-07-20 22:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(818759, 91187, 18349, '<td valign="top">Cute idea; your model looks tormented...you aren''t harrassing the help since you don''t have a monkey, are you????  LOL  I wish I could see more of the faces and less negative space on the bottom, but that''s just me.  Good idea!  ;o)</td>', 'Cute idea; your model looks tormented...you aren''t harrassing the help since you don''t have a monkey, are you????  LOL  I wish I could see more of the faces and less negative space on the bottom, but that''s just me.  Good idea!  ;o)', '2004-07-20 22:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(818762, 90288, 16259, '<td valign="top">words? very nice photograph .. but no words.</td>', 'words? very nice photograph .. but no words.', '2004-07-20 22:41:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(818776, 90434, 10263, '<td valign="top">The colors in this are great. The building in the back ground is beautiful but not sure I like them in the same photo. Takes away from the van. Fits the challenge well :)</td>', 'The colors in this are great. The building in the back ground is beautiful but not sure I like them in the same photo. Takes away from the van. Fits the challenge well :)', '2004-07-20 22:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(818777, 91188, 10263, '<td valign="top">The colors here are great. Its a bit hard to look at the photo for long because of the blury foreground.  It fits the challenge well :)</td>', 'The colors here are great. Its a bit hard to look at the photo for long because of the blury foreground.  It fits the challenge well :)', '2004-07-20 22:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(818779, 90337, 10263, '<td valign="top">I like the old country look. The tones are nice. Its not a WOW but its interesting, easy to look at and  fits the challenge well.</td>', 'I like the old country look. The tones are nice. Its not a WOW but its interesting, easy to look at and  fits the challenge well.', '2004-07-20 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(818783, 90856, 10263, '<td valign="top">Hope you tell us how you did this. Fits the challenge and is an interesting shot.</td>', 'Hope you tell us how you did this. Fits the challenge and is an interesting shot.', '2004-07-20 23:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(818793, 90062, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very impressive shot of a warning.</td>', 'A very impressive shot of a warning.', '2004-07-20 23:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(818795, 90460, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is funny, funny, funny.</td>', 'This is funny, funny, funny.', '2004-07-20 23:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(818796, 91015, 22734, '<td valign="top">Aha, the universal use of this old adage. A clear message and well presented.</td>', 'Aha, the universal use of this old adage. A clear message and well presented.', '2004-07-20 23:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(818797, 90349, 7628, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see something through the holes - perhaps berries or pasta?  It would add maning to the words here.</td>', 'I wish I could see something through the holes - perhaps berries or pasta?  It would add maning to the words here.', '2004-07-20 23:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(818799, 91058, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very funny. Wish I could do  the same with cats.</td>', 'Very funny. Wish I could do  the same with cats.', '2004-07-20 23:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(818801, 90749, 7628, '<td valign="top">While the focus and light are good on the photo of the model, the woman pushing the pram is out of focus and overlit.  I like how you framed the top of the picture with the big red "Bargain" sign.</td>', 'While the focus and light are good on the photo of the model, the woman pushing the pram is out of focus and overlit.  I like how you framed the top of the picture with the big red "Bargain" sign.', '2004-07-20 23:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(818804, 91037, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very impressiva and very well done.</td>', 'Very impressiva and very well done.', '2004-07-20 23:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(818805, 91012, 7628, '<td valign="top">Would that some words were this obvious in reality.  I like your composition, framing the bottom of the photo with the hand, cig and ash tray with the bix and warner beyond the smokers attention, but right in ours.</td>', 'Would that some words were this obvious in reality.  I like your composition, framing the bottom of the photo with the hand, cig and ash tray with the bix and warner beyond the smokers attention, but right in ours.', '2004-07-20 23:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(818808, 90253, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the color blue in the mountains.  I wish the sand was lit better - more contrast?  To make it hold up to the impact of the mountains and the bright sky.  I might crop some off the top to bring the focus down on the word more?</td>', 'I like the color blue in the mountains.  I wish the sand was lit better - more contrast?  To make it hold up to the impact of the mountains and the bright sky.  I might crop some off the top to bring the focus down on the word more?', '2004-07-20 23:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(818810, 90840, 7628, '<td valign="top">Cool looking bus.  It is a great subject for a photo.  If you''d found it elsewhere than on the highway you might have had more time to think about composition.  Perhaps this odd bus rendered you speachless, but I don''t think it really fits the challenge.</td>', 'Cool looking bus.  It is a great subject for a photo.  If you''d found it elsewhere than on the highway you might have had more time to think about composition.  Perhaps this odd bus rendered you speachless, but I don''t think it really fits the challenge.', '2004-07-20 23:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(818814, 90453, 23412, '<td valign="top">I like the two possible meanings of the word:  Could be referring to Mr. Mullett there, wearing the flag, or it could be innocently referring to the trash receptacle.  FWIW, I would prefer it without the arrow on the sign.  IMO, that sort of takes away from the ambiguity, which has the potential to add to the strength of the photo.</td>', 'I like the two possible meanings of the word:  Could be referring to Mr. Mullett there, wearing the flag, or it could be innocently referring to the trash receptacle.  FWIW, I would prefer it without the arrow on the sign.  IMO, that sort of takes away from the ambiguity, which has the potential to add to the strength of the photo.', '2004-07-20 23:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(818816, 91035, 7628, '<td valign="top">Full of feeling, nicely composed, nice tonal range.  Fits well with the challenge - doubly so with the poeme about words!</td>', 'Full of feeling, nicely composed, nice tonal range.  Fits well with the challenge - doubly so with the poeme about words!', '2004-07-20 23:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(818818, 90359, 7628, '<td valign="top">Scrabble is a clever subject for the challenge.  I would find this more interesting if you included the faces of players and how they react to the game/eachother.  This feels too static.</td>', 'Scrabble is a clever subject for the challenge.  I would find this more interesting if you included the faces of players and how they react to the game/eachother.  This feels too static.', '2004-07-20 23:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(818825, 89751, 23412, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  The lighting doesn''t help, though.  Your lettering is hard to see in that angle, and the photo is pretty dark overall.  Perhaps a lighter image reflected behind the letters would have let them show through more.  Also, the partial brand name and  the door frame are somewhat distracting.</td>', 'Good idea.  The lighting doesn''t help, though.  Your lettering is hard to see in that angle, and the photo is pretty dark overall.  Perhaps a lighter image reflected behind the letters would have let them show through more.  Also, the partial brand name and  the door frame are somewhat distracting.', '2004-07-20 23:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(818827, 90035, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is a funny idea!  I like how you''ve played with the words and their meaning in reality.  The written and the visual complement eachother and give the viewer a laugh.  I like how you''ve filled the frame.  The focus on the pot and spade if a bit soft, and the resolution seems grainy.</td>', 'This is a funny idea!  I like how you''ve played with the words and their meaning in reality.  The written and the visual complement eachother and give the viewer a laugh.  I like how you''ve filled the frame.  The focus on the pot and spade if a bit soft, and the resolution seems grainy.', '2004-07-20 23:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(818830, 90508, 7628, '<td valign="top">While all these headlines are an interesting start, they alone are just too "flat" and without context.  Where are they?  Who is reading them?  They could be in a trash pile or they could be carefull stacked by a desk waiting to go into a scrap book.  The photo doesn''t show us.</td>', 'While all these headlines are an interesting start, they alone are just too "flat" and without context.  Where are they?  Who is reading them?  They could be in a trash pile or they could be carefull stacked by a desk waiting to go into a scrap book.  The photo doesn''t show us.', '2004-07-20 23:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(818835, 89774, 23412, '<td valign="top">Seems to have DOF issues....focus is on again-off-again.  I like the way you composed it with flowers, pearls and rings.  Small thread and a few specs either on the page or on the lense take away a bit.</td>', 'Seems to have DOF issues....focus is on again-off-again.  I like the way you composed it with flowers, pearls and rings.  Small thread and a few specs either on the page or on the lense take away a bit.', '2004-07-20 23:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(818836, 89403, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the golden color and the rays of light across the page.  But the words are out of focus, and we cannot see the texture of the page or get any context of where this bible is or what we should think about it.  Perhaps a hand pointing out a special passage, or an object that relates to the text?</td>', 'I like the golden color and the rays of light across the page.  But the words are out of focus, and we cannot see the texture of the page or get any context of where this bible is or what we should think about it.  Perhaps a hand pointing out a special passage, or an object that relates to the text?', '2004-07-20 23:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(818840, 91000, 23412, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I understand the relationship of the graffitti and the background.  If they are unrelated--which based on focus, I am guessing they must be-- then I don''t really understand the value of not getting more of the sign and less of the background.</td>', 'I''m not sure I understand the relationship of the graffitti and the background.  If they are unrelated--which based on focus, I am guessing they must be-- then I don''t really understand the value of not getting more of the sign and less of the background.', '2004-07-20 23:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(818841, 89853, 7628, '<td valign="top">Hee hee!!  I had to look at this a few times to see how this worked.  A clever idea.  I cannot say the composition or the lighting is inspiring, but the photo serves its purpose in making us pay attention not only to the meaning of words but the form of the letters and possible reorganizations.</td>', 'Hee hee!!  I had to look at this a few times to see how this worked.  A clever idea.  I cannot say the composition or the lighting is inspiring, but the photo serves its purpose in making us pay attention not only to the meaning of words but the form of the letters and possible reorganizations.', '2004-07-20 23:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(818842, 91009, 23412, '<td valign="top">Interesting craft skills you have there.  :)  I like the foreground focus and the blurred out color in the background.  Maybe just a bit more green area at the top to suit my taste, but overall very nice.</td>', 'Interesting craft skills you have there.  :)  I like the foreground focus and the blurred out color in the background.  Maybe just a bit more green area at the top to suit my taste, but overall very nice.', '2004-07-20 23:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(818843, 89406, 7628, '<td valign="top">Do they have nasty fangs?  This picture made me laugh.  I like the composition - the placemnt of the sign and the way the road bends away from it and heads into the desolate looking snowy mountains.  It looks like it couldd have better resolution - a bit grainy and fuzzy.</td>', 'Do they have nasty fangs?  This picture made me laugh.  I like the composition - the placemnt of the sign and the way the road bends away from it and heads into the desolate looking snowy mountains.  It looks like it couldd have better resolution - a bit grainy and fuzzy.', '2004-07-20 23:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(818845, 91073, 7628, '<td valign="top">What a glorious view!  Perfect clouds.  The light of the signs and the detail of the wood grain is good as well as focus, and still the landscape in the background is well lit and clear too.  Nice job.  I would like to see where the sign attached to the ground - as is it feels like it is oddly floating.</td>', 'What a glorious view!  Perfect clouds.  The light of the signs and the detail of the wood grain is good as well as focus, and still the landscape in the background is well lit and clear too.  Nice job.  I would like to see where the sign attached to the ground - as is it feels like it is oddly floating.', '2004-07-20 23:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(818849, 90810, 7628, '<td valign="top">An awful lot of words in this photo.  That does say a lot about your subject - baseball is commercial.  But the objects clutter the fram and with this arrangement I don''t know what to look at first.  Perhaps emphasizing something with a narrow depth of focus or with selective lighting would help the viewer understand better.</td>', 'An awful lot of words in this photo.  That does say a lot about your subject - baseball is commercial.  But the objects clutter the fram and with this arrangement I don''t know what to look at first.  Perhaps emphasizing something with a narrow depth of focus or with selective lighting would help the viewer understand better.', '2004-07-20 23:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(818851, 89875, 12160, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Nice composition and the good colors.</td>', 'Great idea. Nice composition and the good colors.', '2004-07-20 23:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(818852, 91111, 7628, '<td valign="top">Ironic.  I love the abstract shapes here and how they fill the space, how they contract in tone and texture.  And in the midst of it all a bold word that simultaneously fits with the others, but doesn''t.  Very nice. 9</td>', 'Ironic.  I love the abstract shapes here and how they fill the space, how they contract in tone and texture.  And in the midst of it all a bold word that simultaneously fits with the others, but doesn''t.  Very nice. 9', '2004-07-20 23:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(818854, 91011, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The words made a whole lot of difference in conveying the message in the photo.</td>', 'Nicely done. The words made a whole lot of difference in conveying the message in the photo.', '2004-07-20 23:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(818855, 91197, 7628, '<td valign="top">1984.  Interesting depiction.  Words and power and overwhelm - wish we could see more of the person reacting to them.  I like the cold blue color as well.</td>', '1984.  Interesting depiction.  Words and power and overwhelm - wish we could see more of the person reacting to them.  I like the cold blue color as well.', '2004-07-20 23:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(818857, 89971, 7628, '<td valign="top">Looks like an intriguing subject, but the artifacts from sharpening are too distracting (the heavy lines and halos around the letters)</td>', 'Looks like an intriguing subject, but the artifacts from sharpening are too distracting (the heavy lines and halos around the letters)', '2004-07-20 23:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(818858, 91106, 7628, '<td valign="top">The pairing of the sign and planes is humorous, but the background is too busy and distracts from the subject.</td>', 'The pairing of the sign and planes is humorous, but the background is too busy and distracts from the subject.', '2004-07-20 23:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(818860, 91152, 7628, '<td valign="top">A colorful closeup.  These objects work well with the words.  Wish the glass and lime were in focus.</td>', 'A colorful closeup.  These objects work well with the words.  Wish the glass and lime were in focus.', '2004-07-20 23:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(818862, 89853, 23412, '<td valign="top">Too funy!</td>', 'Too funy!', '2004-07-20 23:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(818864, 90757, 7628, '<td valign="top">My husband also equates the words JOY and BIKE.  Nice idea.  I like the bold orange against the white background.  I like the narrow DOF.</td>', 'My husband also equates the words JOY and BIKE.  Nice idea.  I like the bold orange against the white background.  I like the narrow DOF.', '2004-07-20 23:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(818866, 90728, 7628, '<td valign="top">Charming child - no really!  And I like the concept of this photo and how her face fills the frame.  However (I imagine yo''ve heard this already) there is no word!  If only you could tuck some big words under her tongue it word have worked!<br/></td>', 'Charming child - no really!  And I like the concept of this photo and how her face fills the frame.  However (I imagine yo''ve heard this already) there is no word!  If only you could tuck some big words under her tongue it word have worked!', '2004-07-20 23:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(818867, 91118, 7628, '<td valign="top">Unique idea.  I like the look of the words illuminating the rose.  It might have been bolder on a dark background, and could be a bit sharper, but nice idea, well done. 7</td>', 'Unique idea.  I like the look of the words illuminating the rose.  It might have been bolder on a dark background, and could be a bit sharper, but nice idea, well done. 7', '2004-07-21 00:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(818873, 91186, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, good choice of B&amp;W.  The sparkles of the dress and the smoothness of the breasts contassta well.  Wish the pages weren''t so white/ didn;t fill so much of the image.  Still, I think this should do well.  Fits the challenge nicely.</td>', 'Nicely done, good choice of B&W.  The sparkles of the dress and the smoothness of the breasts contassta well.  Wish the pages weren''t so white/ didn;t fill so much of the image.  Still, I think this should do well.  Fits the challenge nicely.', '2004-07-21 00:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(818876, 90648, 18349, '<td valign="top">OK...it fits the challenge, and is fairly technically sound, but it''s just so disturbing that I can''t even think straight!  I hope you didn''t touch anything around that payphone...  LOL</td>', 'OK...it fits the challenge, and is fairly technically sound, but it''s just so disturbing that I can''t even think straight!  I hope you didn''t touch anything around that payphone...  LOL', '2004-07-21 00:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(818882, 90160, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite.  The color of the background and the jumble of letters cannot overwhelm or distract from this dapper young man in black and white and a serious face and cool skate board.  But the Grafiti works with him - we hope he will rise to challenges that come his way.  Very candid, but well thought out, engaging, inspiring. 10</td>', 'This is my favorite.  The color of the background and the jumble of letters cannot overwhelm or distract from this dapper young man in black and white and a serious face and cool skate board.  But the Grafiti works with him - we hope he will rise to challenges that come his way.  Very candid, but well thought out, engaging, inspiring. 10', '2004-07-21 00:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(818885, 90460, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very enjoyable, well done.  The whimsicle font plays well on the fairy tale.  I like the colro and pose of the frogs.  Their spots do seem over-sharpened tho - some artifacts and funny dark lines.  still I really like this! 9</td>', 'Very enjoyable, well done.  The whimsicle font plays well on the fairy tale.  I like the colro and pose of the frogs.  Their spots do seem over-sharpened tho - some artifacts and funny dark lines.  still I really like this! 9', '2004-07-21 00:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(818889, 91117, 7628, '<td valign="top">Great colors and an engaging composition.  That line of bikes to the right, and above the bright red letters, all against a sky blue building.  Nice that the sunlight is just catching the front ends of the bikes.  Simple, good. 8</td>', 'Great colors and an engaging composition.  That line of bikes to the right, and above the bright red letters, all against a sky blue building.  Nice that the sunlight is just catching the front ends of the bikes.  Simple, good. 8', '2004-07-21 00:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(818890, 89940, 7628, '<td valign="top">the textures and colors are great!  The composition is a natural - sign is right on the "thirds line''  and even the shadow creates a shape that works well with the rest. 8</td>', 'the textures and colors are great!  The composition is a natural - sign is right on the "thirds line''  and even the shadow creates a shape that works well with the rest. 8', '2004-07-21 00:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(818892, 91096, 12825, '<td valign="top">This is a great macro shot, but IMHO it does not meet the challenge criteria.</td>', 'This is a great macro shot, but IMHO it does not meet the challenge criteria.', '2004-07-21 00:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(818893, 90021, 12825, '<td valign="top">A little out of focus.  I''m betting you shot this freehand -- if so, try using a tripod in a similar shooting situation in the future.</td>', 'A little out of focus.  I''m betting you shot this freehand -- if so, try using a tripod in a similar shooting situation in the future.', '2004-07-21 00:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(818895, 91062, 7628, '<td valign="top">Neat! I like how the water warps the word.  The word and the color go together and work for the challenge.  I would like the water drops to spead off the edges of the frame rather than being confined to the center.  Also the color range and lighting are a bit subtle and the subject doesn;t pop out like it could with more contrast. 8</td>', 'Neat! I like how the water warps the word.  The word and the color go together and work for the challenge.  I would like the water drops to spead off the edges of the frame rather than being confined to the center.  Also the color range and lighting are a bit subtle and the subject doesn;t pop out like it could with more contrast. 8', '2004-07-21 00:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(818900, 90752, 12825, '<td valign="top">This image suffers from a bit of noise from the low light.  Personally I''m not fond of the composition.</td>', 'This image suffers from a bit of noise from the low light.  Personally I''m not fond of the composition.', '2004-07-21 00:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(818901, 90253, 18349, '<td valign="top">Good use of the rule of thirds.  Love the color scheme and detail; beautiful concept for this challenge.  :o)</td>', 'Good use of the rule of thirds.  Love the color scheme and detail; beautiful concept for this challenge.  :o)', '2004-07-21 00:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(818902, 89853, 12825, '<td valign="top">Nice work!  Perfect fit for the challenge.  This is my favourite of all the entries.</td>', 'Nice work!  Perfect fit for the challenge.  This is my favourite of all the entries.', '2004-07-21 00:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(818907, 89863, 22734, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge quite well. A very imposing sign. Good capture.</td>', 'This fits the challenge quite well. A very imposing sign. Good capture.', '2004-07-21 00:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(818908, 90726, 23412, '<td valign="top">Well, it is certainly an interesting composition, and the words are a good match for the action figure''s look-down posture.  I think the lighting is right on the mark, with the only mis-step being the glare on the book face just above the top (leftmost) and right above the word Earth.  The horizontal line of the book is almost centered and the left-right settings are pretty much split as well.  It would be interesting to see the lower dark area increased a bit to make it more of a two thirds portion of the photo.   This almost begs for another book at the lower portion for him to be looking at.  Of course, that one would be titled simply, BOOK.  Good shot, HTH.</td>', 'Well, it is certainly an interesting composition, and the words are a good match for the action figure''s look-down posture.  I think the lighting is right on the mark, with the only mis-step being the glare on the book face just above the top (leftmost) and right above the word Earth.  The horizontal line of the book is almost centered and the left-right settings are pretty much split as well.  It would be interesting to see the lower dark area increased a bit to make it more of a two thirds portion of the photo.   This almost begs for another book at the lower portion for him to be looking at.  Of course, that one would be titled simply, BOOK.  Good shot, HTH.', '2004-07-21 00:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(818916, 90600, 18349, '<td valign="top">This could have more power...possibly crop the white sign out all together; dodge/burn the clouds for definition and emphasis; adjust that shadow on the foreground building; maybe bring out the color in the bricks a tad more.  Good foundation; needs tweaking.  :o)</td>', 'This could have more power...possibly crop the white sign out all together; dodge/burn the clouds for definition and emphasis; adjust that shadow on the foreground building; maybe bring out the color in the bricks a tad more.  Good foundation; needs tweaking.  :o)', '2004-07-21 00:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(818933, 91118, 18349, '<td valign="top">"Love"ly idea...very visually appealing.  One tiny nitpick...two small dots that I''m sure you wish you could have spot-edited out, as they distract the eye a tad.  Beautiful color and light.  :o)</td>', '"Love"ly idea...very visually appealing.  One tiny nitpick...two small dots that I''m sure you wish you could have spot-edited out, as they distract the eye a tad.  Beautiful color and light.  :o)', '2004-07-21 00:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
