(818944, 91185, 22385, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge.  I love how you''ve got the sun behind the rock.  The whole composition is pleasing to the eye.  Good focus.  I assume this is your hand?  I hope this photo does well!</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge.  I love how you''ve got the sun behind the rock.  The whole composition is pleasing to the eye.  Good focus.  I assume this is your hand?  I hope this photo does well!', '2004-07-21 00:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(818946, 91193, 18349, '<td valign="top">Although technically lacking, this image is perfect for the challenge and makes an important point.  Focus could be a bit sharper and lighting a bit less harsh on the left side, but still effective in its own right.  :o)</td>', 'Although technically lacking, this image is perfect for the challenge and makes an important point.  Focus could be a bit sharper and lighting a bit less harsh on the left side, but still effective in its own right.  :o)', '2004-07-21 00:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(818947, 90408, 22385, '<td valign="top">This photo is in my top ten for the challenge.  I love the expression on the cat''s face.  I think this photo is composed well and the focus is good on everything except for one of the most important things: the cat''s eyes.  I have a feeling this may hurt your photo in the challenge.  But I still like it!</td>', 'This photo is in my top ten for the challenge.  I love the expression on the cat''s face.  I think this photo is composed well and the focus is good on everything except for one of the most important things: the cat''s eyes.  I have a feeling this may hurt your photo in the challenge.  But I still like it!', '2004-07-21 00:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(818949, 89929, 22385, '<td valign="top">Very humorous!  I really like this photo.  It''s creative, and I have a feeling it will do fairly well.  At least in the top third.  But it''s in my top ten.</td>', 'Very humorous!  I really like this photo.  It''s creative, and I have a feeling it will do fairly well.  At least in the top third.  But it''s in my top ten.', '2004-07-21 00:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
