(819554, 90856, 11467, '<td valign="top">Nearly all comments ask how I did this.<br/>I made the letters by tapeing photocopy paper together and sticking them onto the side of my car. Then set the camera up on a tripod, with a more powerfull external flash. Set the self timer and ran into the car. After the flash went off I accelerated backwards to give the streaks.</td>', 'Nearly all comments ask how I did this.I made the letters by tapeing photocopy paper together and sticking them onto the side of my car. Then set the camera up on a tripod, with a more powerfull external flash. Set the self timer and ran into the car. After the flash went off I accelerated backwards to give the streaks.', '2004-07-21 04:05:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(819559, 90854, 21253, '<td valign="top">I guess I expected too much for people''s monitors to be adjusted for a full color range.  Those gray scales are placed under the pictures you are voting on for a reason.  I guess it doesn''t pay to be subtle.  <br/> <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-07-21 03:18:39.</i></td>', 'I guess I expected too much for people''s monitors to be adjusted for a full color range.  Those gray scales are placed under the pictures you are voting on for a reason.  I guess it doesn''t pay to be subtle.   ', '2004-07-21 04:17:15.000000', '2004-07-21 04:18:39.000000', 0),
(819563, 91045, 6771, '<td valign="top">I love the shot.  Very daring and original compared to most seen here.  Alot of people wanna see purdy stuff, and not usually the darker side.<br/>those words are none new to me.  I get called them almost daily as an ED RN.  Sad huh?  To help and still be verbally and emotionally abused.  Strikes a cord here.   Nice work!!</td>', 'I love the shot.  Very daring and original compared to most seen here.  Alot of people wanna see purdy stuff, and not usually the darker side.those words are none new to me.  I get called them almost daily as an ED RN.  Sad huh?  To help and still be verbally and emotionally abused.  Strikes a cord here.   Nice work!!', '2004-07-21 04:24:09.000000', NULL, 0),
