(819614, 90349, 23428, '<td valign="top">Thank you for your comments Adine, i was trying for the light projecting the words onto the worktop but could only get the pasta in shot, the more i looked at it the more i realised i should have used one word and concentrated on getting that. thanks once again</td>', 'Thank you for your comments Adine, i was trying for the light projecting the words onto the worktop but could only get the pasta in shot, the more i looked at it the more i realised i should have used one word and concentrated on getting that. thanks once again', '2004-07-21 05:16:22.000000', NULL, 0),
