(819721, 90726, 9821, '<td valign="top">Wooohooo!! Thanks everyone, I wasn''t expecting the wooden man to do this well. For those who asked, the set up is as follows:<br/> <br/>I have a 1/2 wall in my house between the kitchen and dining room - I drapped a black cloth over it, and then another black cloth behind hanging from the ceiling. Set the book on the shelf and shoot. I used the 420ex flash and bounced it off the ceiling, but under exposed just a touch so both black cloths meshed into each other so it would look like the book was floating.<br/> <br/>I knew that big freakin'' book would come in handy some day :)</td>', 'Wooohooo!! Thanks everyone, I wasn''t expecting the wooden man to do this well. For those who asked, the set up is as follows: I have a 1/2 wall in my house between the kitchen and dining room - I drapped a black cloth over it, and then another black cloth behind hanging from the ceiling. Set the book on the shelf and shoot. I used the 420ex flash and bounced it off the ceiling, but under exposed just a touch so both black cloths meshed into each other so it would look like the book was floating. I knew that big freakin'' book would come in handy some day :)', '2004-07-21 07:11:22.000000', NULL, 0),
