(819895, 91114, 21724, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by heida:</b></div><hr/><i> Does it mean something that he has men on his forehead? ;) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Actually, I didn''t even notice that until I got it in my computer!  I tried to make him stand in a position where no one word stood out, and I found that it was pretty much impossible.  I also printed off the poem "Desiderata" onto a transparency, and I was going to use that, but it just didn''t have the same effect.</td>', 'Originally posted by heida: Does it mean something that he has men on his forehead? ;)   Actually, I didn''t even notice that until I got it in my computer!  I tried to make him stand in a position where no one word stood out, and I found that it was pretty much impossible.  I also printed off the poem "Desiderata" onto a transparency, and I was going to use that, but it just didn''t have the same effect.', '2004-07-21 10:12:56.000000', NULL, 0),
