(1615037, 91193, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good thought, well expressed. The presentation could be better, after all, this is a place more concerned with presentation than ideas. I hope you had an opportunity to revisit this one and do justice to the subject. I like how 4 words express things that are visual and 2 express personhood. Gene fits into both groups.<br/>Good luck thinking up new challenge entries.</td>', 'Good thought, well expressed. The presentation could be better, after all, this is a place more concerned with presentation than ideas. I hope you had an opportunity to revisit this one and do justice to the subject. I like how 4 words express things that are visual and 2 express personhood. Gene fits into both groups.Good luck thinking up new challenge entries.', '2005-08-16 16:58:14.000000', NULL, 0),
