(1633898, 91073, 39144, '<td valign="top">Oooh. Another Arizonan. Well, I guess I''m not technically an Arizonan anymore. But I spent many years hiking those trails in Flagstaff. This is a great shot. I really like the great depth of the landscape combined with the closeness and clarity of the sign. Nice work.</td>', 'Oooh. Another Arizonan. Well, I guess I''m not technically an Arizonan anymore. But I spent many years hiking those trails in Flagstaff. This is a great shot. I really like the great depth of the landscape combined with the closeness and clarity of the sign. Nice work.', '2005-08-22 23:22:30.000000', NULL, 0),
