(4667910, 90288, 83817, '<td valign="top">How terrible to score this photo that low (maybe you didn''t meet the challenge?) It''s a great shot with really nice pink and the green really contrasts it well,  nice clarity and composition...It deserved much better!<br/> <br/>ammended: I see that it didn''t meet the challenge - was supposed to indicate words??? - but other than that, it''s a wonderful shot. Some people just don''t appreciate the flower shots even when they DO meet the challenge...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-04-30 12:47:20.</i></td>', 'How terrible to score this photo that low (maybe you didn''t meet the challenge?) It''s a great shot with really nice pink and the green really contrasts it well,  nice clarity and composition...It deserved much better! ammended: I see that it didn''t meet the challenge - was supposed to indicate words??? - but other than that, it''s a wonderful shot. Some people just don''t appreciate the flower shots even when they DO meet the challenge...', '2008-04-30 13:44:48.000000', '2008-04-30 13:47:20.000000', 0),
